config DMA_PHY62X2
	bool "PHY62x2 DMA driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_PHYPLUS_PHY62X2_DMA_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the DMA controller of the PHY62x2: four channels, one block per transfer, memory to
	  memory and between memory and the peripherals.
